function dockGroupForModule(module){if(module==='dashboard')return'home';if(module==='reports')return'reports';if(module==='qd2429')return'qd2429';for(const [key,g] of Object.entries(currentDockGroups())){if(g.direct===module||(g.items||[]).includes(module)||(g.subgroups||[]).some(sub=>sub.items.includes(module)))return key}return'more'}
